 "text": "Hello! How's everything today? Panniers with wheels are the most convenient, you just wheel them in through the shop. If you have a heavy load, a front basket and a rear bag work too. A basket is fine for small shops, but it fills up fast with heavy stuff. A bag and basket combination works better for most people. It' heavy and slides around, so it' best for short trips. Panniers with wheels really beat them.",
